    "COM-001: refreshed affected source copies; added 12 COM-AC and 12 CALL-TC. Production telephony remains deferred.",
    "COM-002: first ETA quick message is editable and requires explicit Send; FR-044, UC-16, COM-AC-12 and CALL-TC-12 clarified.",
    "HOV-001: prototype handoff verification, 15 HOV-AC; final QR/location verification and version audit. Radius/override provisional; production QR mapping, stop coordinates and native iOS/Android acceptance unresolved. referencePrototypeCommit remains the historical COM-002 reference, not a commit for this working increment.",
    "2026-11-05: updated Pre-trip and Post-trip to four checks and thirteen required photos, preserving completed inspection records.",
