    "2026-11-06: label generation and scan use one successful location scenario with test coordinates.",
    "2026-11-06: documented pending contact confirmation and local dispatcher follow-up for Pickup and Delivery.",
    "2026-11-06: Pre-trip and Post-trip prototype use separate vehicle and equipment photos, odometer readings, driver confirmation and preserved history.",
    "2026-11-06: added a separate next-day warehouse Route Loading flow with a frozen place manifest and complete-load validation.",
    "2026-11-06: warehouse return closes the active route and records its own timestamp before separate Post-trip inspection.",
    "2026-11-06: extended the local sync queue to field and warehouse operations, with partial failure and revision-aware retry."
